      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, i'm confused. You just said i can have them but then you said i need to avoid them? lol. I really need the protein for my workouts though... if I just eat them in small amounts or once in a while, is it actually dangerous or is it just like, a minor thing? I don't want to have to change my whole diet if I don't have to.",
